-->
   (<s> ^operator <op> +)
   (<op> ^name overcome ^task-operator true ^action-handle overcome ^argument1 <c> ^argument2 <v> ^argument3 <n> ^argument4 <s1> ^argument5 <s2> ^argument-count 5 ^desireds <pre>)
